%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f235e9a96eb7bbb419458f22113d08f2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - text: And so we arrive at our final game, darling.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 1
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I must admit, you've managed to entertain me more than I expected. Though,
      naturally, that doesn't mean you are worthy of my admiration.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Tell me\u2026 do you remember the four lucky numbers that accompanied
      you throughout our little evening?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 5
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Don't worry, I'll grant you one last chance to prove that your memory is
      as good as your fortune.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 2
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: If you guess all four numbers right, your soul remains yours.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "But if you're wrong\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 5
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Hehehe\u2026 I'm afraid you'll end up belonging to someone far more interesting
      than yourself.\r\nCome now, darling. Don't disappoint me."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 1
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
